    "title": "Buna man arrested on warrant for Continuous Family Violence - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Scott Lawrence ,\n4 hours ago JASPER COUNTY — The Jasper County Sheriff's Office has arrested a Buna man on a felony warrant for Continuous Family Violence. Deputies served the warrant today at the end of County Road 804 on Christopher Stimits, 41, and transported him to the Jasper County Jail, according to Sheriff Chuck Havard. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
